  "summary": "The paper studies AI‑driven DevOps integration for hybrid quantum‑classical retail systems using Qiskit simulators and serverless infrastructure. Reported improvements include a 51% reduction in deployment time (45→22 minutes), ~35% reduction in QPU usage time (12.5→8.1 minutes), circuit depth reduction from 850 to 550 gates (35.3%), and business‑level gains such as 47% faster dynamic pricing responses and 22% lower inventory costs. The work evaluates DevOps workflow efficiency rather than demonstrating computational quantum advantage.",
